{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119015","id":3592179320,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7WHE54","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119015","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119015.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119015.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119015","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119015/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119015/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119015/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/30c8a11062f00b444c4ed388b686a1ad9102e1b9","number":119015,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Mono: Generate dispatch entries for C# methods with default parameters","user":{"login":"ayd0","id":73216273,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMjE2Mjcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73216273?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayd0","html_url":"https://github.com/ayd0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayd0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayd0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayd0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayd0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayd0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayd0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayd0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayd0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayd0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #59025 \r\n\r\nWhen calling a C# method with default parameters from GDScript, the call fails with `Invalid call. Nonexistent function` because the generated `InvokeGodotClassMethod` dispatch only matches the exact total param count.\r\n\r\nFor example, a method like `Log(string msg, string offsetChar = \" \")` only generated a dispatch entry for `args.Count == 2`, so calling `Log(msg)` from GDScript with one argument wouldn't match.\r\n\r\nThis PR generates dispatch entries for each valid argument count, so callers can omit arguments that have default values. For methods with no default params, behavior is unchanged. ","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":709269775,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MDkyNjk3NzU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:dotnet","name":"topic:dotnet","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subs